      "value": "<p>At 20th level, when a summoner makes a blood pact with his avatar, the bonuses increases. Empower: The avatar gains a +8 morale bonus to its casting stat and a +4 bonus to caster level. Rage: The morale bonus to Strength and Constitution increases to +8, and the morale bonus on Will saves increases to +4. Ward: The dodge bonus to AC increases to +6, the resistance bonus to saves increases to +6, and the damage reduction increases to 6/-.</p>",
